# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored.

# Where an ask from the "Say hello to your new co-worker" composer is delivered.
# This site is served by GitHub Pages, which runs no code of ours, so this has to
# be a third-party URL that accepts a JSON POST from the browser. Any of these:
#
#   Formspree   https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx      (free tier, ~2 min to set up)
#   Basin       https://usebasin.com/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Getform     https://getform.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Zapier      https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/000000/xxxxxx
#   HubSpot     https://api.hsforms.com/submissions/v3/integration/submit/<portal>/<form>
#
# The POST body is:
#   { prompt, email, example, source, page, submittedAt }
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET AND ASKS ARE NOT DELIVERED. The composer detects that and
# offers the visitor a pre-filled mail to support@finsynth.ai instead, so the
# lead is never silently dropped — but it only arrives if they hit send.
VITE_ASK_ENDPOINT=
